ERROR: `get[Boxed20]` copies a value of type `Boxed20` out of a slot, but `Boxed20` is stored as a box pointer — the copy would alias the slot and double-free on drop. Deref-reads are only safe for scalar or inline (small, no-`Drop`) element types; for non-Copy elements use `set`/`swap`, `own` moves, or match arms
